  "example": "输入 { bead_ids:\"\", wrist_size:17, day_master_element:\"金\", month_branch_wuxing:\"金\" } → { type:\"design_proposal\", favorable:[火,水], unsuitable:[{五行金/土珠, reason…}], designs:[{style:\"B-01\",…}], unavailable_styles:[…] }。"
